WEBVTT

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:27.150
<i>We swear that we will continue 
to walk on together.</i>

00:00:45.180 --> 00:00:49.520
Hey, Sainglain! Marian!

00:02:33.920 --> 00:02:36.510
Hurry, this way!

00:02:38.210 --> 00:02:39.930
Good morning, birds!

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.080
Good morning, flowers!

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:43.930
Good morning, sun!

00:02:44.690 --> 00:02:46.560
Good morning, sea!

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:48.640
Good morning, air!

00:02:49.830 --> 00:02:54.140
What a wonderful morning!

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:03.470
Good morning, Papa!

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:06.410
Ow! H-Hot!

00:03:06.410 --> 00:03:08.070
Good morning, Mama!

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:10.760
Good morning, Miranda.

00:03:10.760 --> 00:03:12.270
You're full of life again today.

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:16.250
Huh? I'm the world's most 
pitiable kid today.

00:03:16.250 --> 00:03:17.430
Oh, is that so?

00:03:18.030 --> 00:03:19.300
Why, you ask?

00:03:19.300 --> 00:03:23.210
That's because my hair 
just isn't right today.

00:03:23.210 --> 00:03:25.810
It's almost like that 
of a doll who not only

00:03:25.810 --> 00:03:27.770
never gets bought, but ends 
up being thrown into the trash,

00:03:27.770 --> 00:03:29.520
waiting there to be incinerated.

00:03:29.800 --> 00:03:31.190
Y-You think so?

00:03:31.190 --> 00:03:32.680
Mama, you understand, right?

00:03:32.680 --> 00:03:34.770
You see how shabby I look 
this morning, right?

00:03:35.120 --> 00:03:37.050
There's no way you didn't notice.

00:03:37.050 --> 00:03:40.010
Or did you avert your eyes on 
purpose so you don't see me?

00:03:40.010 --> 00:03:41.800
Are you ignoring me? Am I stupid?

00:03:41.800 --> 00:03:44.530
N-Now that you mention it, 
you might be right...

00:03:45.050 --> 00:03:48.290
I knew it, I am a poor, poor 
girl who has been abandoned

00:03:48.290 --> 00:03:50.810
and ridiculed by her family.

00:03:50.810 --> 00:03:52.570
Oh, cruel fate!

00:03:52.570 --> 00:03:54.540
M-Miranda, you're so cute...

00:03:54.690 --> 00:03:57.460
Yes! Very, very cute!

00:03:58.430 --> 00:03:59.960
Really?

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.930
Yes!

00:04:01.930 --> 00:04:02.880
Certainly!

00:04:04.170 --> 00:04:08.890
Ah, I am so happy!

00:04:09.360 --> 00:04:16.100
I hope that everybody in the 
world is as happy as I am.

00:04:16.100 --> 00:04:16.900
Oh yeah,

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:20.030
let's go to grandmother's today.

00:04:21.000 --> 00:04:23.540
I'm sure she's bored, being all alone,

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.030
so I'll go over to visit her.

00:04:25.230 --> 00:04:27.280
Maybe that's not a good idea.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.790
Oh, what's wrong?

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:31.580
Don't tell me she is ill.

00:04:31.580 --> 00:04:32.120
An ingrown nail?

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.050
A hangnail?

00:04:33.050 --> 00:04:34.120
A sty?

00:04:34.120 --> 00:04:35.790
She broke her leg.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:40.300
Oh gosh, why didn't you tell 
me? That's horrible, Papa!

00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:42.440
Oh, poor grandmother!

00:04:42.440 --> 00:04:45.210
Hang in there, I'm coming to visit you!

00:04:45.800 --> 00:04:48.060
Wai— Miranda!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:05:00.880
Mi-Mi-Miranda's my name!

00:05:01.350 --> 00:05:02.890
Everyone!

00:05:05.230 --> 00:05:06.740
Hello, bird!

00:05:07.480 --> 00:05:11.790
I feel something wonderful is 
going to happen today!

00:05:18.290 --> 00:05:20.710
Wow, I'm really something, huh?

00:05:20.710 --> 00:05:23.900
I'm totally sure they 
believe that we're dead.

00:05:24.330 --> 00:05:25.340
They do, right?

00:05:25.340 --> 00:05:27.800
That's the art of misleading.

00:05:28.220 --> 00:05:30.670
I didn't think it would go this well.

00:05:30.670 --> 00:05:31.810
Right?!

00:05:32.070 --> 00:05:33.370
But it's all thanks to

00:05:33.370 --> 00:05:35.350
the night we spent at that old castle.

00:05:36.040 --> 00:05:38.000
We were able to check 
out all the rooms

00:05:38.000 --> 00:05:39.770
and junk in there beforehand.

00:05:40.540 --> 00:05:42.850
Granted it was dark, 
and they weren't too close,

00:05:42.850 --> 00:05:46.590
Still, I didn't think they'd 
fall for such a simple trick.

00:05:53.980 --> 00:05:56.320
It looks like they stopped 
following us, too.

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:58.330
That'll make traveling easier.

00:05:58.590 --> 00:06:01.450
You can thank me for all of that.

00:06:01.450 --> 00:06:04.240
Oh, you'd go that far without even

00:06:04.240 --> 00:06:06.360
having seen my amazing acting?

00:06:06.360 --> 00:06:07.740
You're right.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:09.380
But they really had to believe it

00:06:09.380 --> 00:06:11.320
since you even had a funeral!

00:06:13.400 --> 00:06:16.100
It was really hard to not laugh.

00:06:16.730 --> 00:06:19.350
It's about a week to 
the capital from here.

00:06:20.150 --> 00:06:21.270
What should we do?

00:06:21.270 --> 00:06:22.490
If we push ourselves a bit

00:06:22.490 --> 00:06:24.490
we can make it to the next city.

00:06:24.820 --> 00:06:26.860
What? We have to walk more?

00:06:27.600 --> 00:06:29.590
Huh? Wait a sec...

00:06:30.170 --> 00:06:31.070
What's wrong?

00:06:31.500 --> 00:06:32.960
My stomach hurts.

00:06:33.500 --> 00:06:35.190
It's kind of contracting or something.

00:06:35.610 --> 00:06:36.910
Go to the bathroom.

00:06:36.910 --> 00:06:39.080
I don't think that's it.

00:06:40.450 --> 00:06:42.500
Kids these days.

00:06:42.500 --> 00:06:45.120
Age has nothing to do with it!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:48.420
Come on, I'm in serious pain here.

00:06:48.880 --> 00:06:51.960
Did you eat something weird 
from the ground on the way?

00:06:52.670 --> 00:06:55.550
Why do I have to be treated 
like some stupid dog?

00:06:55.550 --> 00:06:57.430
Aren't you supposed to 
worry about my illness?

00:06:57.710 --> 00:07:00.370
Illness? Do you have an 
idea what it could be?

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:02.190
No, not really.

00:07:02.610 --> 00:07:03.980
See?

00:07:04.190 --> 00:07:05.740
That's it?

00:07:05.740 --> 00:07:07.560
No love, none at all, huh?!

00:07:10.760 --> 00:07:14.550
Grandmother, eat as much as you 
need for a speedy recovery.

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:22.180
I'll stay by your side 
and take care of you.

00:07:22.730 --> 00:07:25.390
Oh, what's that? 
There's dirt on the floor!

00:07:25.810 --> 00:07:28.010
That's poison for your body.

00:07:43.130 --> 00:07:43.970
Oh?

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:46.800
You went to sleep already?

00:07:49.910 --> 00:07:52.380
I don't want to disturb your sleep.

00:07:52.380 --> 00:07:53.790
I'll leave you for now.

00:07:55.820 --> 00:07:59.020
Unlike you guys, I'm sensitive.

00:07:59.020 --> 00:08:00.830
Yeah, yeah.

00:08:00.830 --> 00:08:03.020
At least pretend to listen!

00:08:04.310 --> 00:08:06.710
I'm actually annoyed.

00:08:13.720 --> 00:08:14.820
Oh, sorry.

00:08:15.890 --> 00:08:18.280
What are you doing, Kon?

00:08:18.280 --> 00:08:22.230
We're sorry. He's not feeling well.

00:08:25.060 --> 00:08:26.510
Sorry about that.

00:08:37.390 --> 00:08:39.760
<i>The world is shining so brightly!</i>

00:08:40.240 --> 00:08:43.780
<i>It's sparkling like a fairy tale.</i>

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:45.770
I'm sorry, milady.

00:08:46.130 --> 00:08:48.440
Just like the honey bee 
is drawn to flowers,

00:08:48.440 --> 00:08:51.260
it was fate that you
 and I should meet.

00:08:52.190 --> 00:08:54.980
Do you understand our destiny?

00:08:55.540 --> 00:09:00.180
Yes I do, for you are my honey bee.

00:09:03.670 --> 00:09:07.150
We're sorry, he's not feeling well

00:09:07.150 --> 00:09:09.270
and doesn't have any time left.

00:09:09.270 --> 00:09:12.230
What?!

00:09:19.310 --> 00:09:20.750
Sorry about that.

00:09:20.750 --> 00:09:22.630
Please forget about him.

00:09:23.320 --> 00:09:24.120
<i>Why?</i>

00:09:25.640 --> 00:09:27.860
<i>I finally met the man 
who is my destiny.</i>

00:09:28.600 --> 00:09:30.140
<i>Why are we being pulled apart again?</i>

00:09:30.140 --> 00:09:32.630
<i>How cruel! How tragic!</i>

00:09:33.350 --> 00:09:35.460
No! I won't give up!

00:09:35.800 --> 00:09:39.250
I'll save him, even if I 
have to sell my soul for it!

00:09:42.930 --> 00:09:44.960
If you're feeling so bad,

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:46.980
why don't you go see a doctor?

00:09:47.770 --> 00:09:49.150
I'll do that...

00:09:53.880 --> 00:09:57.150
Oh, you poor man. 
He's giving up on life.

00:09:57.920 --> 00:09:59.660
My life

00:10:00.310 --> 00:10:02.650
is more fickle than a sigh.

00:10:03.360 --> 00:10:07.120
I want to just hug him right now!

00:10:11.980 --> 00:10:12.620
You idiot!

00:10:14.340 --> 00:10:16.130
Idiot, idiot, idiot!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:20.140
You don't even know how 
much I believe in you!

00:10:23.640 --> 00:10:26.890
Without you, this world doesn't shine!

00:10:27.540 --> 00:10:31.160
Without you, flowers won't 
bloom, rice won't grow,

00:10:31.160 --> 00:10:32.900
and pigs won't have piglets!

00:10:33.390 --> 00:10:37.260
Without you, I... I...

00:10:39.000 --> 00:10:40.650
I can't smile!

00:10:43.220 --> 00:10:46.250
Miranda, I apologize.

00:10:57.600 --> 00:10:58.650
That's right.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:11:00.980
My full force pep talk, my coaching,

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:04.390
my instructions are what will save him!

00:11:04.390 --> 00:11:05.600
Because I love you!

00:11:14.600 --> 00:11:15.690
I guess it's here.

00:11:16.850 --> 00:11:17.930
Wait!

00:11:20.090 --> 00:11:21.160
I guess it's here.

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:23.590
Everything will be over soon.

00:11:23.590 --> 00:11:24.720
Wait!

00:11:26.300 --> 00:11:29.050
Why do you think that?! You idiot!

00:11:29.050 --> 00:11:31.570
You can always start over!

00:11:38.490 --> 00:11:40.130
You worm!

00:11:44.640 --> 00:11:46.010
That's why you're trash!

00:11:47.640 --> 00:11:49.580
Come back when you're no 
longer wet behind the ears!

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:55.690
Miranda!

00:12:01.240 --> 00:12:02.700
You were hit?

00:12:03.080 --> 00:12:04.030
By whom?

00:12:04.360 --> 00:12:06.700
By some girl...

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:09.040
Why would she hit someone like you?

00:12:09.280 --> 00:12:11.230
What's that supposed to mean?

00:12:11.230 --> 00:12:12.260
Ow, ow, ow...

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:15.130
You probably did something 
to make her mad.

00:12:15.130 --> 00:12:17.540
Like cheat on her with 
two or three or four people.

00:12:17.540 --> 00:12:20.260
What? We were always together!

00:12:20.260 --> 00:12:22.620
When would I have had 
the time for that?!

00:12:22.620 --> 00:12:25.870
Stop making fun of me! 
No, stop praising me!

00:12:25.870 --> 00:12:27.140
Stop overestimating me!

00:12:27.140 --> 00:12:30.050
Just so you know, 
my experience level is mega low!

00:12:30.050 --> 00:12:32.300
You went there before 
anybody else could.

00:12:32.300 --> 00:12:34.270
Yeah, I did. So sue me!

00:12:34.770 --> 00:12:36.210
Then what was it?

00:12:36.210 --> 00:12:37.190
I don't know!

00:12:37.190 --> 00:12:40.490
Well, in any case, 
you should go to the doctor.

00:12:40.490 --> 00:12:41.780
I know that!

00:12:43.100 --> 00:12:44.780
Did it happen yet?

00:12:45.180 --> 00:12:48.430
Did he awaken to true love yet?

00:12:49.730 --> 00:12:52.200
I'll go with you, so toughen up.

00:12:53.020 --> 00:12:54.290
Thank you.

00:12:55.590 --> 00:12:57.670
What? Who is that woman?

00:12:57.670 --> 00:12:59.710
I want to go with you.

00:12:59.710 --> 00:13:02.450
But I want you to be tough.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.180
Kon, you had a string of bad luck.

00:13:06.570 --> 00:13:10.440
Be careful. Bad luck often 
comes in a big lump.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:13.260
What's with the scary prophecy?

00:13:13.260 --> 00:13:15.680
Anyway, we're off.

00:13:15.680 --> 00:13:16.190
Okay.

00:13:17.710 --> 00:13:19.440
I can't believe it.

00:13:20.620 --> 00:13:22.180
You're such a player.

00:13:22.180 --> 00:13:24.230
You two look good together.

00:13:27.910 --> 00:13:29.310
He used me.

00:13:29.310 --> 00:13:32.950
He used me and threw me 
away like a dirty rag!

00:13:33.450 --> 00:13:34.440
He's an enemy to all women!

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.160
A demon!

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:38.290
I won't forgive you!

00:13:39.090 --> 00:13:42.530
I'll punish you in the name of god!

00:14:03.440 --> 00:14:04.770
Why?

00:14:04.770 --> 00:14:06.800
Be hit! Just eat it!

00:14:06.800 --> 00:14:10.200
Stab, slash! And die 
in the storm of love!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:13.700
Watch out!

00:14:19.090 --> 00:14:20.620
What's the big idea?

00:14:33.490 --> 00:14:34.480
Are you showing off?!

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:35.980
You're the worst!

00:14:41.050 --> 00:14:42.480
What?

00:14:45.780 --> 00:14:47.760
It's just food poisoning.

00:14:47.760 --> 00:14:49.660
It'll get better if you avoid overeating

00:14:49.660 --> 00:14:52.490
and eat foods that aid digestion 
for two or three days.

00:14:53.130 --> 00:14:54.540
Oh, really?

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:57.040
But you have a broken bone.

00:14:57.260 --> 00:15:00.540
Oh, bone... What?!

00:15:00.810 --> 00:15:03.540
Your collarbone, what happened?

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:08.480
Well you see, all of a 
sudden this pretty girl

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:10.840
attacked me with a sword 
as big as herself.

00:15:10.840 --> 00:15:11.960
That's dangerous.

00:15:12.330 --> 00:15:13.550
It is.

00:15:13.820 --> 00:15:14.850
And the reason?

00:15:14.850 --> 00:15:18.010
That's just it. I don't have any idea.

00:15:18.010 --> 00:15:18.990
Oh my.

00:15:18.990 --> 00:15:20.890
"Oh my" is right.

00:15:21.170 --> 00:15:23.580
If this were a romance novel,

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.210
I'd be in line for a tee-hee 
he-he main character future.

00:15:27.210 --> 00:15:28.950
I mean, amok-running, super-energetic

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:30.670
heroines have their own genre.

00:15:30.670 --> 00:15:32.410
After this, the huge-chested 
older woman character,

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:33.780
the flat-chested lolita character,

00:15:33.780 --> 00:15:35.450
and the awkward, bespectacled 
genius character

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:37.230
should be making their entrance.

00:15:38.660 --> 00:15:39.660
You know what I'm talking about?

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:42.670
Not at all.

00:15:43.730 --> 00:15:44.950
I thought as much.

00:15:50.200 --> 00:15:53.680
I'm asking if you really 
don't have any idea.

00:15:53.920 --> 00:15:55.300
I don't!

00:15:55.300 --> 00:15:57.080
If I did, I'd be bragging about it.

00:15:57.080 --> 00:15:58.250
That's true.

00:15:59.110 --> 00:16:01.290
You accepted that a bit too quickly.

00:16:01.290 --> 00:16:02.350
What do you want?

00:16:02.770 --> 00:16:06.400
Shut up! A boy's heart is complicated!

00:16:06.660 --> 00:16:09.340
I'm so stupid, so foolish.

00:16:09.340 --> 00:16:12.360
But I couldn't do it. 
I couldn't finish him off.

00:16:13.210 --> 00:16:17.280
Why? Why? Why do I love 
such a horrible man?

00:16:17.280 --> 00:16:18.250
Could it be...

00:16:23.290 --> 00:16:26.880
Barkeep, I've fallen in love.

00:16:30.470 --> 00:16:33.790
Such a cute girl shouldn't 
fall in love with me.

00:16:35.630 --> 00:16:39.490
That's why I did things that 
would hurt her on purpose.

00:16:40.350 --> 00:16:42.900
It's stupid, right? But you know what?

00:16:42.900 --> 00:16:45.070
This pain is love.

00:16:46.000 --> 00:16:47.290
Do you understand?

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.730
That's how it was...

00:16:51.040 --> 00:16:52.400
That's what it was!

00:16:52.980 --> 00:16:55.880
Your pain! Your kindness!

00:16:56.360 --> 00:16:58.410
I didn't know any of that!

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:02.200
But now I know your true feelings!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.000
Your eternal love!

00:17:07.780 --> 00:17:09.670
He's stubborn.

00:17:13.160 --> 00:17:15.910
It's no good. It still hurts.

00:17:15.910 --> 00:17:17.290
I'll go to bed when I get back.

00:17:20.560 --> 00:17:22.810
Accept my heart!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:41.390
<i>Goodbye, unlucky life.</i>

00:17:41.390 --> 00:17:45.930
<i>Goodbye, my tiny savings 
of about 7800 yen.</i>

00:17:47.170 --> 00:17:50.010
<i>Goodbye, game accounts.</i>

00:17:50.010 --> 00:17:51.410
<i>I even had a triple rig going with one</i>

00:17:51.410 --> 00:17:53.300
<i>main character and two sub accounts.</i>

00:17:53.300 --> 00:17:56.310
<i>I even brought them up to level 80!</i>

00:17:57.550 --> 00:18:00.580
<i>No! The treasured pictures 
on my hard drive!</i>

00:18:00.580 --> 00:18:03.420
<i>All my interests and fetishes 
will be known to the world!</i>

00:18:03.420 --> 00:18:06.060
<i>Without formatting that, 
I could never allow myself to die.</i>

00:18:06.060 --> 00:18:08.390
<i>Even my search history for 
"Tour de France pissing"</i>

00:18:08.390 --> 00:18:10.270
<i>and "Ogino method pope" 
is too embarrassing!</i>

00:18:10.840 --> 00:18:12.520
P-Please wait!

00:18:13.170 --> 00:18:15.030
There are things I have to do!

00:18:15.570 --> 00:18:18.530
Things he has to do?

00:18:18.890 --> 00:18:25.870
<i>That must be confessing his l-o-v-e...</i>

00:18:31.120 --> 00:18:32.500
Now's my chance...

00:18:34.630 --> 00:18:37.490
<i>How long are you going 
to wait, Mr. Embarrassed?</i>

00:18:39.600 --> 00:18:42.060
Come on, hurry.

00:18:52.170 --> 00:18:53.170
Hurry!

00:18:53.690 --> 00:18:54.360
Huh?

00:18:54.560 --> 00:18:57.000
It means that I'm not 
totally saying that

00:18:57.000 --> 00:18:59.750
I'm allowing you to 
confess if you insist.

00:18:59.750 --> 00:19:01.450
Don't make me say it, 
it's so embarrassing!

00:19:02.990 --> 00:19:04.450
I'm sorry.

00:19:04.450 --> 00:19:05.820
It's taking me a bit longer to

00:19:05.820 --> 00:19:07.880
understand the meaning of your words.

00:19:07.880 --> 00:19:10.460
Allowing... If you insist?

00:19:10.730 --> 00:19:13.030
"I'm allowing you if you insist" 
obviously does not mean

00:19:13.030 --> 00:19:15.730
"I will do something for 
you" but doesn't mean

00:19:15.730 --> 00:19:18.640
"I want to" or "let's do."

00:19:18.640 --> 00:19:21.100
And "I'm totally not doing 
x or y" is the standard

00:19:21.100 --> 00:19:23.860
tsundere line, which means

00:19:23.860 --> 00:19:26.640
"I'm doing x or y because I like you."

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.800
But the most unclear part about 
this is the word "confess."

00:19:28.800 --> 00:19:30.870
I don't think it's 
supposed to be the kind

00:19:30.870 --> 00:19:35.960
of confession that is beaten out 
of one through inhumane methods.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:39.040
Though in actuality, 
that's happening right now.

00:19:39.040 --> 00:19:41.660
Which leads me to believe 
that I'm supposed to

00:19:41.660 --> 00:19:45.240
confess my feelings.
Confess... But what?

00:19:51.520 --> 00:19:54.500
Fine, then we'll have a duel!

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:06.030
How did he end up in a duel 
by going to the doctor?

00:20:06.030 --> 00:20:08.140
Plot twists are supposed to 
stay believable, you know.

00:20:09.600 --> 00:20:15.560
You're quite right, but it just 
sort of kind of happened.

00:20:16.020 --> 00:20:19.290
If you win, you can do 
whatever you want to me!

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:23.230
I'll let you do what you want!

00:20:23.230 --> 00:20:24.090
Here we go!

00:20:24.890 --> 00:20:27.580
I don't know what you're talking about!

00:20:27.580 --> 00:20:28.620
You're so horrible!

00:20:28.620 --> 00:20:30.450
Those wonderful days we had!

00:20:30.450 --> 00:20:31.670
Those beautiful moments we shared!

00:20:31.670 --> 00:20:33.670
Are you trying to pretend 
they never happened?!

00:20:33.670 --> 00:20:37.460
Pretend or not, we just met!

00:20:37.460 --> 00:20:40.420
So you're going to 
feign ignorance again?

00:20:40.730 --> 00:20:44.840
Hmm? Again, she says.

00:20:44.840 --> 00:20:47.750
No! I honestly don't know her!

00:20:47.750 --> 00:20:49.680
I've totally been dragged into this!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:50.430
I'm going to die!

00:20:51.930 --> 00:20:56.020
If you win, you have no choice 
but to confess to me!

00:20:57.990 --> 00:21:00.440
Have no choice? I don't understand 
the meaning of that.

00:21:00.440 --> 00:21:01.890
You're so stubborn!

00:21:02.650 --> 00:21:03.700
No, seriously...

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.580
Idiot!

00:21:05.840 --> 00:21:08.100
Indecisive fence-sitter! 
Moron! Useless fool!

00:21:08.100 --> 00:21:11.620
Slowpoke! Trash! Dung worm! Reject!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:15.390
Oh, Kon's becoming more 
and more inferior.

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:17.860
He can't help it, 
the enemy's too strong.

00:21:17.860 --> 00:21:19.080
She's in the zone.

00:21:25.930 --> 00:21:28.000
I give up! I'm really sorry!

00:21:28.000 --> 00:21:29.500
There's no way that 
a lowly bottom-feeder

00:21:29.500 --> 00:21:32.180
like me could have 
done anything to you.

00:21:33.080 --> 00:21:34.920
So you finally got it.

00:21:35.290 --> 00:21:36.540
You could have confessed your feelings

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.390
to me if you had won.

00:21:38.390 --> 00:21:41.350
But since you lost, 
I'll deny you that right.

00:21:41.350 --> 00:21:44.410
How presumptuous is it that 
something more pathetic

00:21:44.410 --> 00:21:46.820
than a dung worm wants to confess to me?

00:21:46.820 --> 00:21:49.350
You better live the rest of your 
life in the corner of a toilet,

00:21:49.350 --> 00:21:50.620
or under some rotten stump!

00:21:50.780 --> 00:21:52.540
Yes, ma'am.

00:21:59.900 --> 00:22:02.880
Kon, are you sure we can leave?

00:22:03.340 --> 00:22:06.510
If we stay here any longer, 
I feel like I'll die in an hour or two.

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:12.890
I guess he wants to mend his broken 
heart by getting far away.

00:22:13.400 --> 00:22:16.440
Poor guy. But I guess stalking's bad.

00:22:17.840 --> 00:22:19.580
Is that how you see me?

00:22:19.580 --> 00:22:20.820
Are we wrong?

00:22:22.150 --> 00:22:24.440
No, it's fine. I don't care anymore.

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:33.630
He's wonderful.

00:24:09.920 --> 00:24:24.810
<b>Next Time</b>

00:24:10.830 --> 00:24:14.080
We've finally made it far enough 
to be able to see the capital.

00:24:14.080 --> 00:24:17.400
Which means I can finally 
go back to my own world!

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:20.930
But now that we're here, 
Pet's been acting really suspicious.

00:24:20.930 --> 00:24:24.380
Damn you, have you been 
deceiving us all this time?!

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:29.820
Meanwhile, Erec and 
Incognito did not yet

00:24:24.810 --> 00:24:29.820
suspect that Kon and 
the princess were alive.

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:34.530
Next time, who suspected that 
things would turn out like this?!

00:24:29.820 --> 00:24:34.530
Wait for the high impact development! 
(Don't get your hopes up too much, though (lol))
